the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base equivalentdefinition includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base equivalentdefinition includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/equivalentDefinition.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


def related party is identified by "http://example.org/Def_RelatedParty".

def related party is a definition.

def related party has the definiendum "related party".

def related party is equivalent to def related party equivalent definition.


def related party equivalent definition is a definition.

def related party equivalent definition has for "rdfs:seeAlso" the resource "https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/ias-24-related-party-disclosures/".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query definitions is:
    which thing is a definition.

query definienda is:
    which definition has the definiendum which text.

query equivalent_definitions is:
    which definition has the same meaning as which second definition.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query other_resources is:
    which thing has for which property the resource which resource.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

